In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"key":"A","text":"Both Statement I and Statement II are true"},{"key":"B","text":"Both Statement I and Statement II are false"},{"key":"C","text":"Statement I is true but Statement II is false"},{"key":"D","text":"Statement I is false but Statement II is true"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"A","key":"A"}'::jsonb, 'Standard solution by method of deduction for Chemistry.', 'EASY', 'Chemistry Comprehensive Core', NULL),
  ('e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000065', 65, 'd7e1c77a-3837-4f8a-a673-5c852bd356ab', 'Chemistry', 'MCQ', 4, 1, 'In IUPAC nomenclature, the correct order of decreasing priority of functional group is:', '[{"key":"A","text":"$-\\text{CONH}_2, >\\text{C}=\\text{O}, -\\text{CHO}, -\\text{NH}_2, -\\text{C}\\equiv\\text{C}-$"},{"key":"B","text":"$-\\text{CONH}_2, -\\text{COOCH}_3, -\\text{CHO}, -\\text{NH}_2, -\\text{OH}$"},{"key":"C","text":"$-\\text{CONH}_2, -\\text{CHO}, >\\text{C}=\\text{O}, -\\text{NH}_2, -\\text{C}\\equiv\\text{C}-$"},{"key":"D","text":"$-\\text{CONH}_2, -\\text{CHO}, -\\text{CN}, -\\text{NH}_2, -\\text{C}\\equiv\\text{C}-$"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"C","key":"C"}'::jsonb, 'Standard solution by method of deduction for Chemistry.', 'MEDIUM', 'Chemistry Comprehensive Core', NULL),
  ('e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000066', 66, 'd7e1c77a-3837-4f8a-a673-5c852bd356ab', 'Chemistry', 'MCQ', 4, 1, 'For the given molecule ''x'' (Benzanilide), the preferred site for the attack of the electrophile is:', '[{"key":"A","text":"Predominantly at ''r''"},{"key":"B","text":"''r'' and ''u''"},{"key":"C","text":"''p'' and ''s''"},{"key":"D","text":"Predominantly at ''u''"}]'::jsonb, '{"correct":"D","key":"D"}'::jsonb, 'Standard solution by method of deduction for Chemistry.', 'HARD', 'Chemistry Comprehensive Core', '/diagrams/q66_benzanilide.png'),
  ('e0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000067', 67, 'd7e1c77a-3837-4f8a-a673-5c852bd356ab', 'Chemistry', 'MCQ', 4, 1, 'Match List - I with List - II.

List - I [Mixture of Compounds]:
